  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "How to read pipeline.yaml",
      "items": [
        "target: ${GPU_TARGET} sends every Stage to one compute Target named in backend/.env; there is no default",
        "Each Stage entry picks one Algorithm by name (<stage>.<method>) plus its params",
        "Changing a method or provider is a config change only; pipeline.fake.yaml swaps in the fakes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Key params",
      "items": [
        "ingest: 10–200 keyframes, 3 fps from video, long side 1600 px",
        "recon: Depth Anything 3 Nested Giant at 504 px; align: RANSAC floor at 2 cm",
        "mesh: TSDF voxel 2 cm, up to 3M points; segment: SAM 3 with indoor-en.txt, score ≥ 0.5",
        "lift: seen in ≥ 2 views; embed: MetaCLIP 2, batch 64",
        "graph: on, under, above, inside, next_to, near, against_wall; membership radius 2 cm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Notes",
      "items": [
        "recon writes only per-Frame depth, confidence and poses; the point cloud (points.ply) and mesh (mesh.glb) are both built by Stage 4 mesh",
        "attributes.none writes an empty entry per Instance (ADR-0004)",
        "Arrows are the folders each Algorithm reads, from its reads list in code",
        "Only graph/, embeddings/ and mesh/ leave the Target; the rest stays there"
      ]
    }
  ]
